 {
  "topic": "Python 3.13 traceback formatting and `tbutils` tests",
  "turns": [
   {
    "role": "user",
    "text": "Hey, I'm seeing some `test_tbutils.py` failures on the Python 3.13 nightly builds. The traceback formatting comparison tests are breaking. Is this expected behavior, or something new?"
