 {
  "topic": "Refactoring `formatutils.py` after Python 2.x EOL and `pyupgrade` runs",
  "turns": [
   {
    "role": "user",
    "text": "Hey, I was looking through some of the historical changes in `boltons/formatutils.py` and saw those `pyupgrade` commits (7bd0d48, 675afd8) and the earlier Python 2.x drop (a8fad5e). It got me thinking about `safe_repr`."
